{"deepenroll": "DeepEnroll is an advanced machine learning system for enhancing patient-trial matching in clinical trials. It uses BERT and hierarchical embedding to encode eligibility criteria and patient records into a shared latent space. The system integrates natural language processing and numerical reasoning to match patients based on electronic consent, health data, and numerical information, showing superior performance especially for rare diseases."},
