{"creative_commons_attribution_4_0_international_ccby_4_0_license": "The Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CCBY 4.0) license is a type of copyright license that allows others to remix, tweak, and build upon the work even for commercial purposes, as long as they credit the original creation. It provides a standardized way for content creators to grant copyright permissions."},
