{"www_20": "WWW \u201920 refers to the 2020 International World Wide Web Conference, an annual event organized by the International World Wide Web Conference Committee (IW3C2) to discuss and present advancements and research in the field of the World Wide Web.|Here is another description: WWW \u201920 refers to the 2020 World Wide Web Conference, an annual event that gathers experts and enthusiasts to discuss the latest developments and research in web technologies and applications.|Here is another description: WWW '20 refers to the 29th International World Wide Web Conference, a significant event in the field of web technologies and research.|Here is another description: WWW '20 is the 29th edition of the World Wide Web Conference, a significant event in the field of web research and development. It brings together experts, researchers, and professionals to discuss the latest advancements and trends in web technologies.|Here is another description: WWW \u201920 refers to the 29th ACM World Wide Web Conference, an important event in the field of web research and development.|Here is another description: WWW \u201920 refers to the 29th International World Wide Web Conference, a significant event in the field of web technologies and research."},
