{"trial_eligibility_criteria_ec__are_available__online": "The predicate \"are available\" indicates that the trial eligibility criteria can be accessed or obtained. In this context, it suggests that these criteria are readily accessible to researchers, healthcare providers, and potentially patients themselves, facilitating the process of patient-trial matching and enrollment."},
