{"patient_trial_matching": "Patient-trial matching is the process of identifying and enrolling patients into suitable clinical trials based on their health data and the trials' eligibility criteria. This process ensures that patients are matched with trials that are relevant to their specific health conditions and needs, enhancing the efficiency and effectiveness of clinical research."},
