{"6__compared__cnn_svm_and_knn_as_classifiers_for_ec_classification_in_cancer_domain": "The predicate \"compared\" indicates that the study [6] conducted an evaluation or analysis to assess the performance and effectiveness of different classifiers. This comparison aims to determine which classifier is most suitable for the task of EC (eligibility criteria) classification within the cancer domain."},
