{"ei_m__represented_as__a_sequence_of_words_ei_m_ai_m_1_ai_m_2": "The predicate \"represented as\" indicates the manner in which the subject, ei[(m)], is expressed or depicted. In this context, it shows how the i-th element of the clinical trial is formulated as a sequence of words."},
{"a_sequence_of_words_ei_m_ai_m_1_ai_m_2": "The object, a sequence of words: ei[(m)] = [ai[(m,1)], ai[(m,2)],...], is the representation of the i-th element of the clinical trial m as a series of words. Each word in the sequence corresponds to a specific part of the element, with ai[(m,j)] representing the j-th word in the sequence for element i of trial m."},
