{"a_stack_of_three_200d_tanh_layers": "A stack of three 200d tanh layers represents the structural configuration of the model. Each layer has a dimension of 200, uses the hyperbolic tangent (tanh) activation function, and the entire stack feeds into a softmax classifier at the top layer."},
