{"the_output_latent_state_of_premise_lstm_as_the_input_of_hypothesis_lstm": "The output latent state of the premise LSTM represents the encoded information or hidden state derived from processing the premise text, which is then used as an input to the hypothesis LSTM to facilitate more accurate entailment predictions."},
