{"criteria2query__is__the_current_state_of_the_art_work_for_patient_trial_matching_task": "The phrase \"is the current state-of-the-art work\" signifies that Criteria2Query represents the most advanced and effective approach available in the field of patient-trial matching. It highlights the system's leading-edge status and its superiority over previous methods."},
