{"a_structured_and_computable_representation_using_the_omop_cdm": "A structured and computable representation using the OMOP CDM (Observational Medical Outcomes Partnership Common Data Model) refers to a standardized format that allows for the systematic organization and analysis of clinical data. This model enables interoperability across different data sources and facilitates complex queries and analyses."},
