{"average_f1": "The average F1 is a metric used to measure the accuracy of matching in a multi-label classification task. It is derived from the harmonic mean of precision and recall.|Here is another description: Average F1 is a metric used to evaluate the performance of a model, particularly in the context of classification tasks. It represents the harmonic mean of precision and recall, providing a balance between the two."},
