{"dropout": "Dropout is a regularization technique used in neural networks to prevent overfitting by randomly setting a fraction of input units to zero during training.|Here is another description: Dropout is a regularization technique used in neural networks to prevent overfitting by randomly setting a fraction of input units to zero during training."},
