{"specific_numeric_criteria_for_matching": "Specific numeric criteria for matching refer to the detailed quantitative requirements that must be met for a patient to be considered eligible for a clinical trial. These criteria can include ranges for lab values, age limits, or other measurable conditions that are essential for trial participation."},
