{"f_1_score_for_top_5_results": "The F-1 score for top 5 results refers to a performance metric used to evaluate the accuracy of a model in a specific task, in this case, matching patients to clinical trials based on electronic health records (EHR) and trial descriptions. It is a harmonic mean of precision and recall, providing a balanced measure of the model's effectiveness."},
