{"deepenroll__output_performed_all_baselines_with__a_7_99_improvement": "The phrase \"output performed all baselines with\" indicates that DeepEnroll was evaluated against several established methods or baselines in a comparative study. It signifies that DeepEnroll's performance was measured in relation to these baselines, highlighting its effectiveness and improvements over them."},
{"a_7_99_improvement": "A 7.99% improvement represents the margin by which DeepEnroll outperformed all the baseline methods in the experiment. This metric demonstrates DeepEnroll's superior performance and efficiency in patient-trial matching, especially under challenging conditions such as those involving rare diseases."},
