{"an_ablation_study__to_understand__the_contribution_of_numerical_information_representation_and_entailment_module_nir_in_deepenroll": "To understand, in this context, means to evaluate and analyze the specific contributions and significance of certain modules or components within a machine learning model, such as DeepEnroll, by conducting experiments where these components are removed or altered."},
{"the_contribution_of_numerical_information_representation_and_entailment_module_nir_in_deepenroll": "The contribution of numerical information representation and entailment module (NIR) in DeepEnroll refers to the role and effectiveness of the NIR module in enhancing the model's ability to match patients with clinical trials and predict trial enrollment, as demonstrated through comparative performance metrics when the module is included versus excluded."},
