{"ec_statement_in_the_sixth_row__is__unrelated_to_information_from_patient_ehr": "The predicate \"is\" serves as a linking verb to connect the subject, the EC statement in the sixth row, with its characteristic or state, which in this case is its relation to patient EHR information."},
