{"national_science_foundation_award_iis_1418511_ccf_1533768_and_iis_1838042": "The National Science Foundation award IIS-1418511, CCF-1533768, and IIS-1838042 are specific grants provided by the National Science Foundation to support research in information and intelligent systems, computer and communication foundations, and other related fields."},
{"this_work__is_part_supported_by__the_national_institute_of_health_award_nih_r01_1r01ns107291_01_and_r56hl138415": "The phrase \"is part supported by\" indicates that the research project or study has received partial financial backing from the mentioned funding sources."},
{"the_national_institute_of_health_award_nih_r01_1r01ns107291_01_and_r56hl138415": "The National Institute of Health award NIH R01 1R01NS107291-01 and R56HL138415 are specific grants awarded by the National Institute of Health to support the research project or study. These grants are part of the financial support that the work has received."},
{"model_reproducibility": "Model reproducibility refers to the ability to consistently achieve the same results when running a model under the same conditions. It is crucial for validating the reliability and accuracy of machine learning models."},
{"model_reproducibility__requires__synthetic_data": "Requires indicates a necessary condition or component needed for the subject to function or be achieved. In this context, it signifies that model reproducibility cannot be attained without the specified object."},
