{"unsupervised_entity_and_relation_extraction_from_clinical_records_in_italian": "\"Unsupervised entity and relation extraction from clinical records in Italian\" is a research paper that presents a method for automatically extracting entities and relationships from clinical records written in Italian, without the need for supervised learning or pre-labeled data.|Here is another description: The subject refers to a research study focused on the unsupervised extraction of entities and relations from clinical records written in Italian. This study aims to develop methods that can automatically identify and link relevant medical information without prior training on labeled data.|Here is another description: The subject refers to a research study focused on the unsupervised extraction of entities and relations from clinical records written in Italian. This study aims to develop methods that can automatically identify and link relevant medical information without prior training on labeled data.|Here is another description: The subject refers to a research study focused on the unsupervised extraction of entities and relations from clinical records written in Italian. This study aims to develop methods that can automatically identify and link relevant medical information without prior training data.|Here is another description: The subject refers to a research study focused on the unsupervised extraction of entities and relations from clinical records written in Italian. This study was conducted to improve the processing and analysis of medical data without the need for supervised learning techniques."},
{"unsupervised_entity_and_relation_extraction_from_clinical_records_in_italian__published_in__computers_in_biology_and_medicine": "The predicate \"published in\" indicates the venue where the research findings were disseminated to the scientific community. It signifies that the study underwent a review process and was accepted for publication in a specific academic journal."},
{"computers_in_biology_and_medicine": "\"Computers in biology and medicine\" is an academic journal that publishes research at the intersection of computer science and biomedical applications. It serves as a platform for sharing innovative computational methods and their applications in the field of biology and medicine."},
{"unsupervised_entity_and_relation_extraction_from_clinical_records_in_italian__volume__72": "The predicate \"volume\" indicates the specific issue or edition of the journal in which the research study was published. In academic publishing, a volume typically represents a yearly compilation of issues, and it helps in uniquely identifying and citing the work within the journal's publication history."},
