{"the_web_conference_2020_www_20": "The Web Conference 2020 (WWW \u201920) is an annual international conference that brings together researchers, practitioners, and industry professionals to discuss the latest advancements and challenges in web science and technology. The conference provides a platform for presenting and discussing cutting-edge research, fostering collaboration, and promoting innovation in the field.|Here is another description: The Web Conference 2020 (WWW \u201920) is an annual international conference focused on the World Wide Web, covering various topics such as web technologies, data mining, and human-computer interaction. It serves as a platform for researchers, practitioners, and industry professionals to present their latest findings and innovations.|Here is another description: The Web Conference 2020 (WWW \u201920) is an annual international conference focused on the World Wide Web, covering various topics such as web technologies, data mining, and human-computer interaction. It serves as a platform for researchers, practitioners, and industry professionals to present their latest findings and innovations."},
