{"9": "The object \"9\" specifies the exact number of pages the research paper \"DeepEnroll: Patient-Trial Matching with Deep Embedding and Entailment Prediction\" occupies in the proceedings of The Web Conference 2020 (WWW \u201920). This number reflects the comprehensiveness of the paper, suggesting it covers a substantial amount of research, methodology, results, and discussion within the given page limit.|Here is another description: Volume 9 of 'Neural computation' represents the ninth edition or issue of the journal. It contains a collection of research articles and papers that were published in that specific edition, contributing to the field of neural networks and computational neuroscience."},
