{"12_4_in_average_f1": "The object \"12.4% in average F1\" represents the improvement margin by which DeepEnroll surpassed the best existing methods. This metric, average F1 score, is a standard evaluation measure that balances precision and recall, indicating the effectiveness of the matching process."},
