{"a_hybrid_information_extraction_pipeline": "A hybrid information extraction pipeline refers to a system that integrates both machine learning and rule-based methods to extract and process information. This approach aims to leverage the strengths of both techniques to achieve more accurate and comprehensive results in tasks such as patient-trial matching."},
{"criteria2query__combines__machine_learning_and_rule_based_methods": "The predicate \"combines\" indicates that Criteria2Query integrates or merges two distinct approaches\u2014machine learning and rule-based methods\u2014to achieve its objectives in patient-trial matching."},
