{"patient_criteria": "Patient criteria refer to the specific conditions or parameters that must be met by a patient to be considered eligible for a particular clinical trial or medical study. These criteria are essential for ensuring that participants are appropriate for the study based on their medical history, current health status, and other relevant factors."},
