{"h_n_1_h_n_n": "The object \"{] _[h]_ [(] _[n]_ [)][1] [,][ \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7] _[h]_ [(] _N_ _[n]_ [])\"} represents the set of transformed EHR data points after being embedded into the shared latent space using the matrix _V_. Each _[h]_ [(] _[n]_ [)] corresponds to an EHR data point, and the sequence indicates the distributed representations of these data points.|Here is another description: The subject refers to a set of elements denoted as _h_ [(] _[n]_ [)][1], \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 _h_ [(] _N_ _[n]_ [)], which are part of a classification system."},
