{"numerical_information_in_ec_and_ehr": "Numerical information in EC and EHR refers to the quantitative data contained within Electronic Consents (EC) and Electronic Health Records (EHR). This data is crucial for the module to match and reason over, ensuring accurate and relevant patient-clinical trial matching.|Here is another description: Numerical information in EC and EHR refers to the quantitative data contained within clinical trial enrollment criteria and electronic health records, which the module is designed to process and match."},
