{"bert__predicts__randomly_masked_words_in_a_sequence": "The predicate \"predicts\" in this context refers to BERT's capability to forecast or estimate the original words that have been randomly masked or hidden within a given sequence of text. This prediction is a core part of BERT's training process, enhancing its understanding of language."},
{"randomly_masked_words_in_a_sequence": "Randomly masked words in a sequence are words within a text that have been intentionally hidden or replaced with a placeholder during the training of BERT. These masked words serve as the target for BERT to predict, thereby improving its ability to understand and generate contextually appropriate language."},
