{"clinical_bert": "Clinical BERT is a specialized version of the BERT model tailored for medical and clinical text analysis. It is designed to understand and process medical language more effectively than general-purpose language models.|Here is another description: Clinical BERT is a specialized version of the BERT model that has been pretrained on medical corpora such as PubMed abstracts, PubMed full-text articles, and MIMIC-III doctor notes. It is designed to understand and process clinical text data effectively."},
