{"rare_diseases_list": "The rare diseases list is a comprehensive compilation of medical conditions that are considered rare, maintained by the National Organization for Rare Disorders (NORD). This list serves as a reference for identifying and categorizing rare diseases within datasets like IQVIA.|Here is another description: The rare diseases list is a compilation of conditions that are considered rare, meaning they affect a small percentage of the population. This list is crucial for identifying and categorizing diseases that require specialized attention and research."},
