{"patient_ehr": "Patient EHR (Electronic Health Record) represents the digital version of a patient's paper chart. It contains the medical and treatment history of the patients in one practice. In this context, patient EHRs are generated using synthetic data to create a large, reproducible dataset for analysis and research purposes."},
