{"two_possible_reasons_for_the_low_matching_performance": "The object describes the specific reasons identified for the low matching performance. These reasons include the use of over-simplified abbreviations in trial EC statements, which can be ambiguous and difficult to match with concepts in patient EHR, and the presence of EC statements with high attention weights that are unrelated to patient EHR information."},
