{"ambiguous_and_hard_to_match_with_concepts_in_patient_ehr": "Ambiguous and hard to match with concepts in patient EHR describes the difficulty in clearly interpreting and aligning the over-simplified descriptions with the detailed and structured data found in electronic health records, which can impede accurate data matching and analysis."},
