{"publicly_available_clinical_bert_embeddings": "Publicly available clinical BERT embeddings are pre-trained language model embeddings tailored for clinical text data, designed to enhance natural language processing tasks in the medical domain using the BERT architecture. They are accessible to the public to facilitate research and applications in healthcare and clinical natural language processing."},
