{"publicly_available_clinical_bert_embeddings__author__willie_boag": "The predicate 'author' signifies the relationship where an individual has contributed to the creation, development, or publication of a work. In this context, it indicates that Willie Boag was one of the contributors to the creation of the publicly available clinical BERT embeddings."},
{"publicly_available_clinical_bert_embeddings__author__wei_hung_weng": "The predicate \"author\" signifies the role or contribution of an individual in the creation or publication of a work. In this context, it indicates that Wei-Hung Weng played a significant part in the development and publication of the publicly available clinical BERT embeddings."},
