{"2019": "The year 2019 is significant as it marks the publication year of the work on publicly available clinical BERT embeddings. This year denotes the introduction of these specialized embeddings to the scientific community, allowing for their utilization in various clinical natural language processing applications.|Here is another description: The year 2019 marks the publication year of the Criteria2Query system or its associated research paper, signifying the point at which this innovation was introduced to the medical informatics community."},
