{"clinical_trials_in_rare_disease_challenges_and_opportunities": "\"Clinical trials in rare disease: challenges and opportunities\" is a scholarly article authored by EF. Augustine, HR. Adams, and JW. Mink. The article discusses the various difficulties and potential benefits associated with conducting clinical trials for rare diseases, providing valuable insights for researchers and clinicians in the field.|Here is another description: The subject is a scholarly article titled \"Clinical trials in rare disease: challenges and opportunities,\" authored by EF. Augustine, HR. Adams, and JW. Mink in 2013. The article discusses the complexities and potential benefits associated with conducting clinical trials for rare diseases.|Here is another description: The subject refers to a scholarly article titled \"Clinical trials in rare disease: challenges and opportunities,\" authored by EF. Augustine, HR. Adams, and JW. Mink. This article discusses the various challenges and potential opportunities associated with conducting clinical trials for rare diseases."},
