{"j_child_neurol": "The object, \"J Child Neurol.,\" refers to the Journal of Child Neurology, a peer-reviewed academic journal that focuses on publishing research and reviews related to pediatric neurology. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating knowledge and advancements in the field of child neurology."},
